                                "sense_id": "93436c83-790f-3a4a-b517-99e5e20c1348",
                                "text": "This is his sixth Cup campaign but his first as skipper, a position he inherited after the helmsman Russell Coutts, Butterworth’s longtime alter ego in the afterguard, bolted from Alinghi in 2004."
